        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Work comments:
Xavier Heiligenstein
20th March 2019

Subcategories: room temperature embedding, dehydration, progressive lowering temperature (PLT), freeze-substitution

Matúš Kalaš
20th March 2019

Discussion: Clearing, Thinning, Blotting, Embedding synonyms, related terms Microtomy, etc (see also Matthia&apos;s comment in Sample thinning)

Related term(s) to Volume imaging -- should we add that? In which context(s)?

Further discussion Martin, Laure, Nataša:
- perhaps concern of another ontology
- for further consideration what of that matters for analysis choices (e.g. with the volume)
- Martin: how and when slicing is done in EM will influence analysis</rdfs:comment>
