        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CyTOF"/>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mass_cytometry"/>
        <skos:editorialNote rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Magnus Palmblad
16th November 2022
CyTOF can be considered a generic trademark for a mass cytometer with a time-of-flight mass analyser.</skos:editorialNote>
